<title>USA: Enserch names Henderson COO, Langdon CFO.</title>
<headline>Enserch names Henderson COO, Langdon CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enserch Exploration Inc said on Wednesday it named David Henderson its chief operating officer and Richard Langdon its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Henderson, 45, replaces Gary Junco, who left the company several months ago. Henderson previously was Enserch's executive vice president of worldwide exploration.</p>
<p>Langdon, 46, replaces J.P. McCormick, who is leaving the company, Enserch said. Langdon joins the company from Pennzoil Co.</p>
</text>
